description:
Using the new syntax in S7, the generated `Rd` files are empty outside of the name. 

In order to get correct documentation `MyClass <-new_class("MyClass")` is required.

``` r
library(S7)
out <- roxygen2:::roc_proc_text(roxygen2::rd_roclet(), "
    library(S7)

    #' Arrow
    #' @export
    ClassArrow <- new_class('ClassArrow', properties = list(x = class_double))

    #' Walrus
    #' @name ClassWalrus
    #' @export
    ClassWalrus := new_class(properties = list(x = class_double))
  ")

out$ClassArrow.Rd
#> % Generated by roxygen2: do not edit by hand
#> % Please edit documentation in ./<text>
#> \name{ClassArrow}
#> \alias{ClassArrow}
#> \title{Arrow}
#> \usage{
#> ClassArrow(x = numeric(0))
#> }
#> \description{
#> Arrow
#> }
out$ClassWalrus.Rd
#> % Generated by roxygen2: do not edit by hand
#> % Please edit documentation in ./<text>
#> \name{ClassWalrus}
#> \alias{ClassWalrus}
#> \title{Walrus}
#> \description{
#> Walrus
#> }
```

